---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="SteamHead is a network of people, spaces, and events who collaborate to improve equity in education as the path forward."
>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       HERO
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="hero hero--short" aria-label="About Us">
    <img
      class="hero__bg"
      src="/images/2021/04/20181019_1855150-scaled.jpg"
      alt="SteamHead team and community"
    />
    <div class="container hero__content">
      <h1>About Us</h1>
      <p class="hero__tagline">
        A network of people, spaces, and events collaborating to improve equity
        in education as the path forward.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       MISSION / VISION / VALUES
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="section" aria-label="Mission, Vision, and Values">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mvv-grid">

        <div class="mvv-card">
          <h2>Our Mission</h2>
          <hr class="accent-rule" />
          <p>
            To provide access to quality, relevant education focused on integrating
            design, technology, and community.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mvv-card">
          <h2>Our Vision</h2>
          <hr class="accent-rule" />
          <p>
            We envision a world where individuals are confident in their abilities,
            free to question, and have access to the resources and opportunities they
            need to build a fulfilling life of their own definition.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mvv-card">
          <h2>Our Values</h2>
          <hr class="accent-rule" />
          <ul>
            <li>Equity</li>
            <li>Design Thinking</li>
            <li>Maker Mindset</li>
            <li>Progressive Education</li>
            <li>Open Collaboration</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       ABOUT THE ORGANISATION
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--alt" aria-label="About the organisation">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="two-col">
        <div>
          <h2>Who We Are</h2>
          <hr class="accent-rule" />
          <p>
            SteamHead is a nonprofit founded by educators with a goal to openly share
            educational resources and teaching ideas.
          </p>
          <p>
            We believe that by embracing design thinking and a maker-mindset, education
            can be more engaging and meaningful — and with that, more effective in
            preparing students for success.
          </p>
          <p>
            We're not a company that only does education but rather an umbrella for our
            educators to focus around. This initiative brings teachers from different
            backgrounds together on a platform that not only encourages but celebrates
            the sharing of ideas and learning materials.
          </p>
        </div>
        <img
          src="/images/2018/08/shbridge-logo2.jpg"
          alt="SteamHead community"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       OPEN COLLABORATION
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="section" aria-label="Open collaboration">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Open Collaboration</h2>
      <hr class="accent-rule" />
      <div class="two-col mt-md">
        <p>
          In the SteamHead community, teachers can freely exchange teaching materials,
          strategies, and perspectives. This open sharing is seen as crucial for creating
          a more enriched educational environment, allowing teachers to learn from each
          other's successes and challenges.
        </p>
        <p>
          Through a culture of openness and teamwork, SteamHead aims to empower educators
          by providing a supportive network that enhances the quality of education for
          students worldwide.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       TEAM
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--alt" aria-label="Our team">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Our Team</h2>
      <hr class="accent-rule" />
      <p class="mt-md">
        SteamHead is built by educators, makers, and collaborators from around the world.
        Our residents and team members each contribute to the space and community —
        many becoming continuous contributors over time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       FUNDING
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--dark" aria-label="Funding and sustainability">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Funding</h2>
      <hr class="accent-rule" />
      <div class="two-col mt-md">
        <p>
          SteamHead is proud to be self-funded, which means we run independently and
          don't rely on outside sources for money. This independence gives us the freedom
          to focus on our goals without being influenced by external factors.
        </p>
        <p>
          Additionally, we work together with schools to secure grants. This collaboration
          involves actively participating in the grant writing process, tailoring our
          efforts to meet the specific needs of each school or community.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       JOIN THE COMMUNITY
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="section" aria-label="Join the community">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Join the Community</h2>
      <hr class="accent-rule" />
      <p class="mt-md">
        Educators, did you know that Hackers are lifelong learners contributing educational
        content to their communities? Hackers, did you know teachers from Kindergarten
        through University are advocating for the skills and values in your makerspaces
        to be brought into schools?
      </p>
      <p>
        Join us online to discuss and support each other. No experience required — all
        levels of Educators and Hackers welcome.
      </p>
      <a href="https://www.steamhead.space/contact-us/" class="btn btn--primary mt-md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Get in Touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero--short { padding-block: var(--space-lg); }

  .mvv-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .mvv-card {
    padding: var(--space-md);
    background: var(--color-gray-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border-top: 4px solid var(--color-yellow);
  }
  .mvv-card h2 { font-size: var(--text-2xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); }
  .mvv-card ul { margin-top: var(--space-xs); color: var(--color-dark); }
  .mvv-card li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
</style>
